 "stimulus_html": "<p>For questions 2 – 5, use the graphs below to match each description of a situation in which the volume of water in a tank is a function of time to its corresponding graph.</p>\n<table class=\"unnumbered\">\n<tbody><tr><td>\n    <p><b>Graph 1</b><br> <img alt=\"Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. V shaped graph, line begins on Y axis, Vertex points down.\" src=\"exercises/media/1c90d78c7ff44009.svg\"></p>\n</td>\n  <td>\n    <p><b>Graph 2</b><br> <img alt=\"Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. Line begins at origin, moves upwards and to right. Steeper second segment.\" src=\"exercises/media/8e60d1813342342f.svg\"></p>\n  </td></tr>\n<tr><td> <p><b>Graph 3</b><br> <img alt=\"Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. V shaped graph, line begins on at origin, Vertex points up.\" src=\"exercises/media/a19f620bcb04c4b0.svg\"></p>\n  </td>\n  <td>\n    <p><b>Graph 4</b><br> <img alt=\"Graph on coordinate plane, no grid, Origin O. Line begins at origin, moves upwards and to right, decreases briefly, then increases again.\" src=\"exercises/media/c425b8c464a712aa.svg\"></p>\n  </td></tr></tbody></table>",
